                        <p>The smallest order is <strong>one pack of 100 trays for $30.00</strong> ($0.30 a tray). Every product is sold in packs of 100 at the same price, and shipping is free.</p> <ul> <li><strong>1 pack:</strong> 100 trays for $30</li> <li><strong>5 packs:</strong> 500 trays for $150</li> <li><strong>10 packs:</strong> 1,000 trays for $300</li> </ul> <p>You can order up to 50 packs at a time online. For larger runs, or special sizes, materials and finishes, <a href="/contact/">ask us</a> for a quote.</p>
